S:alignment: data/raw_data/swaralipi/rs001028.pdf (Geetabitan swaralipi)
N:Notes quantized to 16ths, pitch bends applied (scripts/midi_to_ktab.py read_tracks). Sa = C; komal Ni (A#) and Ni (B) both occur, one tivra Ma (F#) in the sanchari.
N:Form played by the MIDI: sthayi (its first line again); antara returning to the first line; sanchari twice; abhog returning to the first line; the rest of the sthayi and its first line to end.
N:The swaralipi sings "nilo hori ke, nilo hori" where the lyrics file has "nilo hori"; the swaralipi is followed.
N:v2: the same notes, lyrics and bars as v1.abc with note values halved (L:1/16, M:2/4, Q:1/4=75 is the speed of v1 at 150); one swaralipi matra = one eighth note here.
